    cons: [
      "No resistance setting, and the Performance Adapter does not fit it",
      "About $1,000 more than an AssaultRunner Pro for a similar-sized surface",
      "Machine weight is 300 lb on Rogue’s listing but 270 lb in an older review",
      "One year of labour and three years on electronics",
    ],
    bottomLine: "The TrueForm most buyers should consider: the brand’s curve and a 400 lb rating at roughly half the Runner’s price.",
