    category: "Hand-Built Flagship Curved Trainer",
    badge: "Facility Pick",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/s?k=curved+manual+treadmill&tag=sktiger-20",
    amazonLabel: "Shop Similar on Amazon",
    image: null,
    reviewUrl: null,
    priceRange: "$6,195–$10,195 by configuration at TrueForm on 5 Nov 2026",
    priceBounds: {"low":6195,"high":10195},
    specs: "54 x 17 in. surface · about 350 lb · rubber, turf, track or Naboso tread · hand-built in Wisconsin",
    pros: [
      "Hand-built in the US with a heavier steel frame and belt than the Trainer",
      "Five tread choices, including turf and track for sled and field-sport work",
      "Lifetime frame, five years on moving parts and electronics, two years of labour",
