              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                The Runner is hand-built in Wisconsin with a heavier steel frame and belt, five tread options, a choice of displays and a 14-week build time. The Trainer is designed by TrueForm and built at its overseas facility, is lighter, ships in one to three business days and costs about half as much. On Rogue’s listings both have a 54 by 17-inch running surface.
