                TrueForm’s warranty page gives both machines a lifetime frame warranty and five years on moving parts. The Runner adds five years on electronics and two years of labour; the Trainer has three years on electronics and one year of labour. Older reviews quote different terms, so get the warranty for your purchase in writing.
